# M10: Check Spelling as You Type. The keyboard goes quiet after each key, and each frame lists the marked ranges (start-end).
T e h space q u i c k space b r o w n space f o x      # "Teh" is marked at its space; "quick" is fine; "fox" is being typed
space j u m p d space o v e r space                    # "jumpd" is marked at its space
home right right right bspace bspace bspace            # the word is taken out: its mark goes with it
T h e                                                  # typed again, the caret on it: nothing to mark, and nothing is
space                                                  # the boundary: checked, and correct
